In article <1r49gb$raf@aurora.engr.LaTech.edu>, lar@engr.LaTech.edu (Layne A. Robinson) writes:
>
>Is there a way to STAY a certain type of monster when wearing a cursed
>ring of P and a blessed ring of PC?  After about twice, it won't let
>me keep typing Vampire Lord or whatever I want to be.  I know I can
>talk off the P and it'll stay, but it's cursed right now.
>
>
>Layne

No, you can't stay polymorphed.  If you keep on both rings, you'll probably
keep re-polymorphing before you rehumanize, but there's always a chance
that a polymorph will fail and you'll return to human instead of 
whatever monster you pick.  Kind of annoying if you polymorphed into
a Vampire Lord to float over Medusa's lake.

The length of time you stay polymorphed is somehow proportional to 
(your level)/(monster level).  So if you are at Exp Level 5, you
won't remain a Vampire Lord for long.
